Subject: php-fpm: point the main config at the relocated Zabbix pool

The zabbix-docker php-fpm main config includes the Ubuntu pool directory,
which does not exist with the HSP php layout. This patch points the include at
the single Zabbix pool file the package installs, leaving the rest of the
upstream config unchanged.

Origin: DHI-internal (relocate the pool include for the HSP php layout)
Base-Tree: git https://github.com/zabbix/zabbix-docker.git f82ffab4b54276b7a0449213535913be142a045f
Verify: cmd `go test ./package/main/zabbix-web-nginx-pgsql/tests -run TestPhpFpmConfigParses -count=1` expect "ok"
Forwarded: not-needed (the include path depends on the DHI php package layout)
Drop-When: never: upstream targets the Ubuntu php layout, which the HSP php packages do not use

--- a/Dockerfiles/web-nginx-pgsql/ubuntu/conf/etc/php/8.5/fpm/php-fpm.conf
+++ b/Dockerfiles/web-nginx-pgsql/ubuntu/conf/etc/php/8.5/fpm/php-fpm.conf
@@ -1,4 +1,4 @@
-include=/etc/php/8.5/fpm/pool.d/*.conf
+include=/etc/php-8.5/php-fpm.d/zabbix.conf
 
 [global]
 
